\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,12)\">Ps 89:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 102:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,26)\">Ps 102:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 104:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,5)\">Ps 104:5</ref> compare v<ref ref=\"Ps 89:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,8)\">Ps 89:8</ref> (followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 3:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,19)\">Prov 3:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 48:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,13)\">Isa 48:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 38:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,4)\">Job 38:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 51:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,13)\">Isa 51:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 51:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,16)\">Isa 51:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 12:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,12,1)\">Zech 12:1</ref>, vault of heaven <ref ref=\"Amos 9:6\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,6)\">Amos 9:6</ref> of <highlight>founding</highlight> the second temple <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:12\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,12)\">Ezra 3:12</ref>, of restoration under Joash, Infinitive <bdbheb>יְסוֺד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:27\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,27)\">2Chr 24:27</ref> metaphor of future Israel <ref ref=\"Isa 54:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,11)\">Isa 54:11</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <highlight>establish</highlight