" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,31)\">1Kgs 5:31</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>found</highlight> (= <b>Qal</b>), followed by active, city <ref ref=\"Josh 6:26\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,26)\">Josh 6:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 16:34\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(11,16,34)\">1Kgs 16:34</ref>, temple <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:31\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,31)\">1Kgs 5:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 4:9\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(38,4,9)\">Zech 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,10)\">Ezra 3:10</ref> Zion <ref ref=\"Isa 14:32\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,32)\">Isa 14:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref> <bdbheb>הִנְנִי יִסַּד</bdbheb> (read <bdbheb>יֹסֵד</bdbheb>; see above) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>establish</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,3)\">Ps 8:3</ref> followed by <bdbheb>עֹז</bdbheb>; <highlight>appoint, ordain</highlight> (late) <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:22\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,22)\">1Chr 9:22</ref> (followed by accusative), <ref ref=\"Esth 1:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,8)\">Esth 1:8</ref> (absolute) <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight>, <bdbheb>יֻסַּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:37\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,37)\">1Kgs 6:37</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>יֻסָּ֑ד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,6)\">Ezra 3:6</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְיסָֻּ֑ד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,10)\">1Kgs 7:10</ref> <bdbheb>מְיסָֻּדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:15\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,15)\">Song 5:15</ref> <highlight>be founded, be laid, of a foundation</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:37\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,37)\">1Kgs 6:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,6)\">Ezra 3:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hag 2:18\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,18)\">Hag 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 8:9\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(38,8,9)\">Zech 8:9</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> = substantive foundation <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,10)\">1Kgs 7:10</ref>, compare <bdbheb>מוסד</bdbheb> below; pillars set on bases, simile of legs <ref ref=\"Song 5:15\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,15)\">Song 5:15</ref>. <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>be founded: Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>הוּסַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,3)\">2Chr 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,11)\">Ezra 3:11</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מוּסָּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref> — <highlight>the being founded, founding</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַל הוּסַד בֵּית י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,11)\">Ezra 3:11</ref> <highlight>because of the founding (laying the foundation) of the house of</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>וְאֵלֶּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הוּסַד שְׁלֹמֹה לִבְנוֺת וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,3)\">2Chr 3:3</ref> and this is (literally these are) <highlight>the founding of Solomon to build</highlight> the house of God, i.e. <highlight>this is the foundation which Solomon laid for building</highlight>, etc.; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מוּסָד מוּסָּד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref> <highlight>a foundation founded</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>well laid</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>חֵפֶשׂ מְחֻפָּשׂ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חָכָם מְחֻכָּם</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 28:11", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 28, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 104:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 104, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Prov 3:19", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ps 24:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 24, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Isa 48:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 48, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ps 104:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 104, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ps 102:26", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 102, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "Hab 1:12", "book": "HAB", "chapter": 1, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ps 89:12", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ps 119:152", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 119, "verse": 152}, {"raw": "Isa 54:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 54, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "2Chr 24:27", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 24, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:7", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 51:16", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 51, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Job 38:4", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 38, "verse": 